# Walkthrough — Preparation UI Layering, Layout Alignment & Horizontal Overflow Fixes
3: Improve the layout density and content hierarchy on preparation pages by narrowing the left exercise selection column to give more room to the main practice viewport, simplifying the labels inside the exercise selection menu, and removing the duplicate Prep Academy logo from the desktop sticky sidebar.
